d that we should consider the environmental impact of our new factory.\",\n      \"options\": [\"It was recommended by the manager that we take into account the potential harm to the environment.\", \"The manager proposed that we think about the possible effects on the environment before making a decision.\", \"He proposed considering the ecological implications of the factory's construction.\", \"The manager suggested we should ignore the environmental concerns.\"],\n      \"answer\": \"It was recommended by the manager that we take into account the potential harm to the environment.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 35,\n      \"question\": \"What I am saying is that we need to re-evaluate our priorities.\",\n      \"options\": [\"The point I'm making is that we should rethink our goals.\", \"I mean to say that we must reassess our objectives.\", \"The thing is, we have to reconsider what's important to us.\", \"It's my opinion that we should review our values.\"],\n      \"answer\": \"The point I'm making is that we should rethink our goals.\"\n  ]\n}",
